.SS Abstract
Compile\-time detection of platform\-enforced W\(haX memory policy.
.PP
This only covers platforms with default, out\-of\-the\-box enforcement.
.PP
Optional/opt\-in mechanisms (Linux grsecurity/PaX MPROTECT, Windows ACG,
Android per\-SDK\-level policy, NetBSD PaX) depend on runtime or build
configuration this file cannot see, so they are left undefined here \-\-
check for them yourself if relevant.
.PP
See platform\-specific memory protection APIs in your own code for how
to actually allocate/transition memory on each platform (e.g.
\f[CR]mmap/mprotect\f[R],
\f[CR]VirtualAlloc\f[R]/\f[CR]VirtualProtect\f[R],
\f[CR]pthread_jit_write_protect_np\f[R]).
